WEBVTT

00:00:52.454 --> 00:00:54.718
After arriving in a magical world...

00:00:54.823 --> 00:00:57.224
...Arusu receives permission
from Atelia to live...

00:00:57.326 --> 00:01:01.559
...with Sheila and Eva in their
home, which is called Dragon House.

00:01:02.965 --> 00:01:06.128
And she began to learn all about
using magical powers...

00:01:06.268 --> 00:01:10.262
...as an apprentice witch, which
she'd always dreamed of becoming.

00:01:11.373 --> 00:01:15.003
But she was to discover
that in order to use magic...

00:01:15.144 --> 00:01:18.409
...witches had to use
the body parts of fairies.

00:02:46.902 --> 00:02:50.270
Tweeny Witches

00:02:54.776 --> 00:02:59.304
The Piskey's Fang

00:03:02.517 --> 00:03:04.542
| read about it in a book once.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.987
Journeys are to be taken
just so you can go home again.

00:03:07.055 --> 00:03:08.489
Arusu!

00:03:09.491 --> 00:03:11.858
That if you don't come back,
it's not a journey...

00:03:11.927 --> 00:03:13.827
...and you've simply moved away.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.059
Whoa! Now that's really witchy!

00:03:17.165 --> 00:03:19.862
Is it medicine to make you taller?

00:03:19.968 --> 00:03:21.045
Hey, I know I'm short!

00:03:21.069 --> 00:03:22.230
Hey, I know I'm short!
Just kidding.

00:03:22.337 --> 00:03:25.102
Hey, I got it!
It's a love potion, right?

00:03:25.207 --> 00:03:29.041
So witches really do make
love potions in huge cauldrons!

00:03:29.144 --> 00:03:29.954
I'm so moved by this sight!

00:03:29.978 --> 00:03:31.673
I'm so moved by this sight!
Listen to me, Arusu...

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:34.010
So? Who are you gonna give it to?

00:03:34.216 --> 00:03:37.208
Wait. Is there such a thing as a
male witch? There can't be, right?

00:03:37.319 --> 00:03:38.946
Witches are supposed to be girls...

00:03:39.021 --> 00:03:40.750
Just listen to me, will you?

00:03:43.625 --> 00:03:45.389
You mean it's just plain, old curry?

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:49.419
That's right. And you were going on
and on, thinking it was a love potion.

00:03:49.498 --> 00:03:50.727
I'm gonna dig in!

00:03:50.899 --> 00:03:53.425
Sheila! Squirting
that stuff on it again!

00:03:53.502 --> 00:03:56.870
Hah, betcha that instead
of wasabi-flavored curry...

00:03:56.972 --> 00:03:58.997
...Sheila could go for
curry-flavored wasabi!

00:03:59.107 --> 00:04:00.233
Arusu!

00:04:01.209 --> 00:04:05.407
Be... kind... to... other people...
Take that!

00:04:06.214 --> 00:04:08.683
Wow... that's amazing, Arusu!

00:04:08.784 --> 00:04:11.378
You've mastered the fire spell too!

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:14.983
But what was that?
Be kind to... whatever?

00:04:15.057 --> 00:04:17.822
Oh, that's the mantra for
casting the fireball spell.

00:04:17.926 --> 00:04:20.827
One... ten... two... eight...
three... four... nine, right?

00:04:20.929 --> 00:04:23.261
That comes out to
be kind to other people in code!

00:04:23.332 --> 00:04:25.562
It's a kind of play on words.
Makes it easier to remember!

00:04:25.634 --> 00:04:26.601
Oh...

00:04:28.603 --> 00:04:30.469
Aren't you hungry?

00:04:30.539 --> 00:04:32.735
We're headed for the
Port of Departure, right?

00:04:32.808 --> 00:04:34.640
Once we get there, we can...

00:04:34.776 --> 00:04:37.837
I think it's going to take us
another three days or so...

00:04:38.246 --> 00:04:40.772
It was so yummy,
that curry you made, Eva!

00:04:43.919 --> 00:04:47.549
Hey, this is super-delicious!
It's more effective than a love potion!

00:04:47.622 --> 00:04:49.920
If you give this to your crush,
he'll fall for you!

00:04:49.991 --> 00:04:53.359
Coming from a human like you,
that gives my confidence a boost!

00:04:53.462 --> 00:04:54.122
Why?

00:04:54.296 --> 00:04:57.527
Because I have no choice
but to become a human mother.

00:04:57.599 --> 00:04:57.909
Huh?

00:04:57.933 --> 00:04:58.242
Huh?
You're still hung up about that?

00:04:58.266 --> 00:04:59.700
You're still hung up about that?

00:04:59.768 --> 00:05:00.667
Well, but...

00:05:00.769 --> 00:05:02.430
Just learn how to use magic.

00:05:02.504 --> 00:05:05.235
If you can master magic
and become a great witch...

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:07.638
...then they won't send you
to the Human Realm.

00:05:07.743 --> 00:05:10.644
I can't. I have a hard time
memorizing those charms...

00:05:10.712 --> 00:05:12.407
Hang on a second. You mean...

00:05:13.348 --> 00:05:15.316
Today we're going to learn
the hallucination spell.

00:05:15.384 --> 00:05:16.909
Didn't I ever tell you?

00:05:17.018 --> 00:05:20.283
Witches who don't make the cut
get sent to the Human Realm...

00:05:20.355 --> 00:05:21.652
...to get married.

00:05:21.757 --> 00:05:24.783
No, I've never heard that one!
I mean, if I had heard about it...

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:26.089
If you had?

00:05:26.228 --> 00:05:29.664
Stop slacking off or do you want
to get sent to the Human Realm?

00:05:30.632 --> 00:05:32.999
| come from that place, you know!

00:05:33.101 --> 00:05:37.834
But Sheila, we can't do the hallucination
spell without a piskey's fang!

00:05:38.407 --> 00:05:40.637
She's right. Where's the piskey's fang?

00:05:40.742 --> 00:05:43.973
You didn't forget to pick one up
at the dungeon, did you?

00:05:44.079 --> 00:05:46.844
I told you that due to certain
circumstances, we don't have one today...

00:05:46.915 --> 00:05:48.610
Circumstances? What kind?

00:05:48.683 --> 00:05:50.742
Come on, tell us what's going on!

00:05:50.852 --> 00:05:53.014
Never mind that. Just learn the mantra!

00:05:58.627 --> 00:06:00.755
Mmm...

00:06:00.929 --> 00:06:03.159
Oh, I see! If we go here...

00:06:03.398 --> 00:06:04.388
Here, look!

00:06:04.499 --> 00:06:08.436
This is the place where the ships
heading for the Human Realm set off.

00:06:08.537 --> 00:06:11.507
Hmm... the Port of Departure, huh?

00:06:13.475 --> 00:06:15.034
But that sure was a big surprise!

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:17.807
Who knew the Human Realm and
the Magical Realm were connected?

00:06:17.879 --> 00:06:20.405
They may be connected, but
it's a one-way street, you know!

00:06:20.482 --> 00:06:23.747
Once they send you there, they say
you can never make it back here!

00:06:23.852 --> 00:06:26.378
And you can never use magic again?

00:06:26.488 --> 00:06:27.148
Right!

00:06:28.757 --> 00:06:31.692
It's not really that bad, you know...
the Human Realm.

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:33.319
There's a lot of sweet stuff to eat!

00:06:33.395 --> 00:06:35.454
Yeah, but isn't it true
that if you become a...

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:38.022
...human's bride, you have to suffer
for the rest of your life?

00:06:38.099 --> 00:06:39.999
You get yelled at, but
you have to just take it...

00:06:40.068 --> 00:06:41.502
...and wipe away your tears...

00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.834
Eva, do you watch a lot of soap operas?

00:06:43.905 --> 00:06:44.371
Huh?

00:06:45.674 --> 00:06:48.302
| mean, my Yoko lives
the easy life, you know!

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:50.504
My dad may have vanished
into thin air, but...

00:06:50.612 --> 00:06:52.341
You mean your mom, Arusu?

00:06:52.447 --> 00:06:55.747
As far as cooking is concerned,
you've got a huge edge, Eva!

00:06:55.951 --> 00:06:56.918
Do you miss her?

00:06:56.985 --> 00:07:01.388
Well, the thing is... if I'm not around,
she could starve to death!

00:07:06.495 --> 00:07:08.190
Listen, I can go on alone.

00:07:08.563 --> 00:07:11.760
It's all right. I can go too...
Anyway, it's all right.

00:07:11.967 --> 00:07:12.559
Huh?

00:07:13.134 --> 00:07:15.000
Going to the Port of Departure?

00:07:15.103 --> 00:07:16.400
You're leaving now?

00:07:17.239 --> 00:07:20.436
Hey, I know how to fly on a broom now,
so it's like sightseeing.

00:07:20.575 --> 00:07:23.169
I'd like to see everything
| can while I'm here.

00:07:23.278 --> 00:07:25.804
Do you even know
what kind of place it is?

00:07:26.515 --> 00:07:27.641
Didn't anyone tell you?

00:07:27.749 --> 00:07:30.480
That's the port where
they send off incompetent witches.

00:07:30.585 --> 00:07:32.280
Oh, well, there's that too, but...

00:07:32.387 --> 00:07:33.582
Do what you want.

00:07:33.655 --> 00:07:36.090
I'll feel a lot better
without you around anyway.

00:07:37.626 --> 00:07:40.459
Listen, how come? Why can't I go?

00:07:40.662 --> 00:07:44.326
Do you realize how many days
it will take to get there by broom?

00:07:44.432 --> 00:07:47.561
Then let's take Dragon House...
Why don't you come with us?

00:07:47.636 --> 00:07:50.503
Don't forget, I'm the
discipline officer of district A.

00:07:50.572 --> 00:07:53.269
How could I just leave
for three or four days?

00:07:53.408 --> 00:07:55.968
And besides, we still have
all those fairies to capture!

00:07:56.044 --> 00:07:57.341
We do, don't we?

00:07:57.512 --> 00:07:58.946
In that case, I'll just...

00:07:59.047 --> 00:08:01.175
Why do you always give up so easily?

00:08:01.249 --> 00:08:01.772
Huh?

00:08:02.417 --> 00:08:06.012
Just because you can't learn magic
or catch any fairies...

00:08:06.154 --> 00:08:09.351
And even if you go to the Port of
Departure, you'll never get to the...

00:08:09.457 --> 00:08:11.152
...Human Realm unless you're grown up!

00:08:11.259 --> 00:08:13.091
You don't understand, Sheila.

00:08:13.161 --> 00:08:13.787
What?

00:08:13.895 --> 00:08:17.627
You just have no idea
how I feel, Sheila!

00:08:19.434 --> 00:08:22.699
They call that place the Witches' Graveyard...
You know that, don't you?

00:08:24.639 --> 00:08:25.037
Oh!

00:08:25.106 --> 00:08:26.369
What's up?

00:08:26.575 --> 00:08:28.339
Oh, uh... it's nothing.

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:30.208
Hey, let's take a break!

00:08:30.579 --> 00:08:32.445
Oh, sure, I guess...

00:08:35.483 --> 00:08:36.109
Whoa!

00:08:36.217 --> 00:08:38.015
Looking for something?

00:08:38.553 --> 00:08:41.716
| mean, we just started flying, and
you already wanted to take a break.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.849
Um, I'm looking for
a four-leafed clover...

00:08:43.925 --> 00:08:45.586
The one that brings good luck?

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:47.025
No, Arusu.

00:08:47.128 --> 00:08:50.154
A four-leafed clover
summons piskey fairies!

00:08:52.534 --> 00:08:54.059
A piskey fang?

00:08:54.169 --> 00:08:55.432
| only need one!

00:08:55.537 --> 00:08:58.507
If you have any left over, I was hoping
| could have one for my class...

00:08:58.573 --> 00:09:02.271
You're the one who let them escape.
How can you even ask?

00:09:05.413 --> 00:09:08.439
Today I'm going to have you
learn the healing spell mantra.

00:09:08.516 --> 00:09:11.178
Hey, what about the piskey fairy's fang?

00:09:11.987 --> 00:09:15.321
Didn't you hear what I said?
You're going to learn the healing...

00:09:15.423 --> 00:09:18.654
Let's go, everyone. What good will
it do just to memorize the mantra?

00:09:18.727 --> 00:09:20.195
Yeah, let's go! Let's go!

00:09:20.261 --> 00:09:20.750
Hey!

00:09:23.198 --> 00:09:23.994
Dammit.

00:09:24.599 --> 00:09:27.364
| hear that the apprentice
witches' disciplinary system...

00:09:27.435 --> 00:09:29.494
...is on the brink of collapse.

00:09:29.871 --> 00:09:31.168
Of course it is.

00:09:31.239 --> 00:09:35.972
After all, their supply of magical
tools has been practically cut off.

00:09:36.244 --> 00:09:37.734
Isn't that right, Atelia?

00:09:37.846 --> 00:09:41.111
A leader who cannot provide the
power of the fairies can never...

00:09:41.182 --> 00:09:42.980
...hope to have any followers.

00:09:43.084 --> 00:09:44.779
Is that what you're implying?

00:09:44.853 --> 00:09:48.380
I'm not implying anything
about the grand master!

00:09:48.523 --> 00:09:53.017
As of today, we have recaptured
12 of the escaped 100 fairy species.

00:09:53.628 --> 00:09:55.596
I will make the special
force pick up the pace...

00:09:55.697 --> 00:09:59.190
That goes without saying!
The entire Witch Realm is in crisis.

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:01.325
If the damage done proves irreparable...

00:10:01.403 --> 00:10:02.213
...how do you plan to take...

00:10:02.237 --> 00:10:03.636
...how do you plan to take...
| certainly hope that...

00:10:03.738 --> 00:10:05.672
...no one has realized what's going on.

00:10:05.774 --> 00:10:07.071
Of course not.

00:10:07.142 --> 00:10:11.045
That nasty habit... You really
should cure yourself of it soon.

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:15.416
See, you have to put a
four-leafed clover on your head or...

00:10:15.517 --> 00:10:17.144
...you can't see the piskey fairy.

00:10:17.218 --> 00:10:20.210
Oh? So you want to capture one, huh?
This piskey fairy.

00:10:20.321 --> 00:10:24.349
I'm not gonna catch one! I'm not
good enough to catch one anyway.

00:10:24.426 --> 00:10:26.070
Are you doing this for Sheila?

00:10:26.094 --> 00:10:26.925
Are you doing this for Sheila?
Uh-huh.

00:10:26.995 --> 00:10:30.590
Because I really should be out
there catching fairies too...

00:10:30.999 --> 00:10:33.991
...but because of the way [ am...
I'm totally useless.

00:10:34.102 --> 00:10:37.402
That's why I thought the least I could do
was to find her a four-leafed clover!

00:10:37.572 --> 00:10:38.549
Are you mad at me?

00:10:38.573 --> 00:10:39.438
Are you mad at me?
Why would I be?

00:10:39.507 --> 00:10:42.772
Well, because now you know you came
along for something like this...

00:10:42.844 --> 00:10:44.141
Hey, did you know?

00:10:44.212 --> 00:10:44.678
Huh?

00:10:44.746 --> 00:10:48.478
Four-leafed clovers actually bring you
good fortune and joy, you know!

00:10:48.616 --> 00:10:49.674
What?

00:10:50.118 --> 00:10:52.610
Is that the kind of plant
a four-leafed clover is?

00:10:53.154 --> 00:10:55.486
Here you go! Now you're all set.

00:10:57.592 --> 00:10:58.491
It's a piskey!

00:10:58.560 --> 00:10:59.537
It's a piskey fairy, Arusu!

00:10:59.561 --> 00:11:00.722
It's a piskey fairy, Arusu!
Are you serious?

00:11:00.795 --> 00:11:02.320
But man, that was fast, wasn't it?

00:11:02.397 --> 00:11:03.660
Come here!

00:11:05.233 --> 00:11:06.310
He's so sweet!

00:11:06.334 --> 00:11:06.892
He's so sweet!
No way!

00:11:06.968 --> 00:11:08.834
Hey, what does it look like?

00:11:08.937 --> 00:11:10.530
Something like this!

00:11:10.638 --> 00:11:12.003
That's not really cute...

00:11:13.708 --> 00:11:15.642
Hey, hand that over, will you?

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:17.369
The piskey fairy's fang.

00:11:17.512 --> 00:11:18.604
That's right.

00:11:18.913 --> 00:11:22.042
The teacher also told us that until
we get home, it's just a field trip...

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:24.617
...but then where I am supposed to go?

00:11:32.794 --> 00:11:35.786
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.268 --> 00:11:44.728
The Port of Departure

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:52.080
That piskey fairy's fang...
Hand it over right now!

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:54.945
That's right, if you don't
want to get destroyed!

00:11:55.116 --> 00:11:58.984
What should we do? We haven't even
reached the Port of Departure yet!

00:11:59.053 --> 00:12:01.147
Don't worry about it! Remember?

00:12:01.256 --> 00:12:04.021
Four-leafed clovers are supposed
to bring you good fortune!

00:12:04.225 --> 00:12:07.388
What kind of drivel is that?
You wanna get clobbered?

00:12:07.495 --> 00:12:10.521
Oh, no! What should we do?
The piskey fairy escaped!

00:12:10.598 --> 00:12:11.690
What did you say?

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:13.791
See, there it goes! Right at your feet!

00:12:13.902 --> 00:12:15.836
Huh? Where? Where?

00:12:15.904 --> 00:12:17.531
See, it's right there! No, no!

00:12:17.639 --> 00:12:19.539
Not there, I mean over there!

00:12:19.607 --> 00:12:19.850
Here?

00:12:19.874 --> 00:12:21.171
Here?
What are you doing?

00:12:21.276 --> 00:12:22.353
Hurry up and catch it!

00:12:22.377 --> 00:12:23.503
Hurry up and catch it!
But I can't see it!

00:12:23.845 --> 00:12:26.837
Ugh, what a pain in the butt!
Just destroy it! Destroy it!

00:12:28.583 --> 00:12:29.794
Hey, that's dangerous!

00:12:29.818 --> 00:12:30.561
Hey, that's dangerous!
Oh, crap... he got away!

00:12:30.585 --> 00:12:31.677
Oh, crap... he got away!

00:12:31.786 --> 00:12:33.754
It's your fault for being so slow!

00:12:33.855 --> 00:12:36.881
Since we don't have the piskey fairy,
you don't need us anymore, do you?

00:12:36.991 --> 00:12:37.368
Let's go!

00:12:37.392 --> 00:12:38.052
Let's go!
Yeah.

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:39.288
Achoo!

00:12:41.062 --> 00:12:43.030
What was that just now?

00:12:43.331 --> 00:12:45.766
That wasn't one of you, was it?

00:12:45.867 --> 00:12:47.926
That's ridiculous! Of course it was!

00:12:48.036 --> 00:12:50.869
Achoo!
See, I've come down with a cold...

00:12:50.972 --> 00:12:51.905
Right?

00:12:52.006 --> 00:12:52.905
Yeah!

00:12:53.241 --> 00:12:54.037
Achoo!

00:12:54.309 --> 00:12:56.334
Oh, looks like I've got a cold too.

00:12:59.581 --> 00:13:01.845
How dare you try to
deceive us like that...

00:13:01.916 --> 00:13:04.010
| guess you really want to be destroyed!

00:13:04.085 --> 00:13:07.578
Hand over that piskey fairy
you're hiding inside your hat!

00:13:11.359 --> 00:13:14.488
Whoa! What's going on here?

00:13:14.729 --> 00:13:15.890
Come on, Eva!

00:13:16.998 --> 00:13:19.365
Did you use some kind of magic just now?

00:13:19.434 --> 00:13:20.144
Of course not!

00:13:20.168 --> 00:13:20.778
Of course not!
You won't get away with this!

00:13:20.802 --> 00:13:21.428
You won't get away with this!

00:13:21.502 --> 00:13:22.867
Yeah, dream on!

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:02.637
They say that piskey fairies do
good things for good people...

00:14:02.744 --> 00:14:05.679
...and they also tend to
play tricks on bad people.

00:14:05.947 --> 00:14:09.110
That snake we just saw... It had to
be the piskey who did that, right?

00:14:09.217 --> 00:14:11.686
Yeah, but saying that they tend to...

00:14:11.786 --> 00:14:13.845
It's pretty ambiguous, isn't it?

00:14:14.155 --> 00:14:17.125
I'm so glad this little piskey didn't
get captured by those people!

00:14:17.225 --> 00:14:19.353
But if Sheila gets her hands on him...

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:21.929
...he'll only end up in the
same place anyway, right?

00:14:21.996 --> 00:14:23.361
Well, I guess...

00:14:26.134 --> 00:14:29.069
I'm totally against this, you know.
Capturing fairies!

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:33.935
| know you are, but...

00:14:35.043 --> 00:14:39.605
Hey, little piskey... would you mind
giving us one of your fangs?

00:14:39.714 --> 00:14:40.579
Arusu!

00:14:40.682 --> 00:14:43.151
But I'm still against
this capturing business.

00:14:43.217 --> 00:14:43.775
Right!

00:14:51.926 --> 00:14:53.655
Why do I feel this way?

00:14:55.763 --> 00:14:58.664
What do they matter, anyway?
Those two...

00:15:01.202 --> 00:15:03.432
That's the Forest of No Return...

00:15:04.038 --> 00:15:06.973
Once you find yourself inside it,
you can never get out again.

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:13.606
Aren't you so glad that little piskey fairy
gave us one of his fangs, Arusu?

00:15:13.781 --> 00:15:15.613
Sure, of course, but...

00:15:15.717 --> 00:15:19.119
...now that we have it,
why don't you hurry back to Sheila?

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:21.084
No, I'm going with you.

00:15:21.189 --> 00:15:24.159
Because I'm worried that you might
not make it back on your own.

00:15:24.258 --> 00:15:25.248
Oh no!

00:15:25.393 --> 00:15:28.852
Whoa! No good, no good!

00:15:29.931 --> 00:15:31.262
Eva!

00:15:36.204 --> 00:15:39.139
Oh, man! I'm way more
worried about you.

00:15:39.707 --> 00:15:40.731
Sorry.

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:52.985
Eva!

00:15:53.654 --> 00:15:55.679
Aren't you around? Eva!

00:15:56.824 --> 00:16:00.385
Something's wrong.
They should've made it here by now.

00:16:06.501 --> 00:16:07.696
No way!

00:16:08.403 --> 00:16:09.632
Could this be...

00:16:09.871 --> 00:16:13.273
Could this be what the
Port of Departure really is?

00:16:16.110 --> 00:16:17.976
Hey, Eva...

00:16:18.079 --> 00:16:18.602
Yeah?

00:16:18.713 --> 00:16:20.704
| have a feeling that
we've been going...

00:16:20.815 --> 00:16:23.341
...around and around the
same place for a while.

00:16:23.418 --> 00:16:25.409
That can't be true.

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:28.979
Well, but we came this way
and then this way. Right?

00:16:29.057 --> 00:16:29.523
Yeah!

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.718
But this says we're in
the Forest of No Return!

00:16:31.793 --> 00:16:32.351
What?

00:16:32.460 --> 00:16:34.724
But once you go into the
Forest of No Return...

00:16:34.829 --> 00:16:36.273
...they say you can never get out again!

00:16:36.297 --> 00:16:38.629
...they say you can never get out again!
Hey, it's gonna be all right!

00:16:38.699 --> 00:16:42.636
Remember what I told you!
Four-leafed clovers bring you good luck!

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:43.698
See?

00:16:43.938 --> 00:16:45.736
For real?

00:16:45.907 --> 00:16:46.850
No way...

00:16:46.874 --> 00:16:47.568
No way...
Look out!

00:16:49.877 --> 00:16:50.810
Arusu!

00:16:50.878 --> 00:16:52.312
What the...

00:16:53.681 --> 00:16:55.171
Arusu!

00:16:55.283 --> 00:16:56.842
Magic, Eva, magic!

00:16:56.951 --> 00:16:59.852
If we don't use magic now,
then when's a better time?

00:16:59.921 --> 00:17:01.116
Yeah, you're right.

00:17:01.222 --> 00:17:02.986
Um, let's see... But...

00:17:04.025 --> 00:17:05.049
Eva!

00:17:06.928 --> 00:17:08.555
Please go, Arusu!

00:17:08.663 --> 00:17:11.325
Never mind me.
Just go to the Port of Departure...

00:17:11.432 --> 00:17:13.730
Hey, that's not an option, okay?

00:17:13.835 --> 00:17:17.271
All right.
Be kind to other people! Take that!

00:17:17.638 --> 00:17:18.730
All right!

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:21.174
But why?

00:17:21.843 --> 00:17:25.643
Oh, come on!
That's the only spell I can cast!

00:17:25.913 --> 00:17:27.540
Hey, hold up! A chestnut!

00:17:27.615 --> 00:17:30.585
I'll give you a chestnut!
So please don't eat that girl!

00:17:30.685 --> 00:17:33.120
Um...um... Is this...

00:17:33.654 --> 00:17:37.284
Arusu! The chestnut!
Where's the chestnut?

00:17:37.859 --> 00:17:39.623
Why don't I give it a shot?

00:17:39.727 --> 00:17:41.195
If I remember correctly...
That's it!

00:17:41.295 --> 00:17:43.821
Delicious... maple syrup strawberry!

00:17:49.937 --> 00:17:52.599
Amazing...
That's amazing, Arusu!

00:17:52.673 --> 00:17:56.109
Wow, so this is the
hallucination spell, huh?

00:17:58.212 --> 00:17:59.441
It's Dragon!

00:17:59.547 --> 00:18:02.380
Now that's what you call
a splashy entrance.

00:18:03.251 --> 00:18:05.618
Was that you? Did you cast that
hallucination spell just now?

00:18:05.686 --> 00:18:06.915
Never mind that. You're late!

00:18:06.988 --> 00:18:08.979
| never said that I'd rescue you.

00:18:09.056 --> 00:18:10.114
Sheila!

00:18:10.992 --> 00:18:12.585
That's why I told you not to go!

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:15.129
Not when you haven't
even mastered magic.

00:18:15.796 --> 00:18:19.289
Look, you! Eva came here for you!

00:18:20.001 --> 00:18:23.596
For your sake...
So she could get one of these for you!

00:18:25.306 --> 00:18:27.707
No, that's not true.
All I did was try to find a...

00:18:27.808 --> 00:18:30.834
...four-leafed clover so we could
find a piskey. It was Arusu who...

00:18:30.912 --> 00:18:35.042
The fact is that you rushed out here
because you were worried, right?

00:18:35.116 --> 00:18:37.414
See, you're wearing your
jacket inside out too!

00:18:37.985 --> 00:18:39.077
On purpose.

00:18:39.654 --> 00:18:40.348
On purpose?

00:18:40.421 --> 00:18:42.116
To keep from getting lost
in the Forest of No Return...

00:18:42.190 --> 00:18:44.056
...you wear your jacket inside out.
That's common sense!

00:18:44.158 --> 00:18:45.169
It's common sense?

00:18:45.193 --> 00:18:46.558
It's common sense?
| forgot all about that.

00:18:57.138 --> 00:19:00.233
Hey! Hold up! Why the heck
are you taking me back?

00:19:00.341 --> 00:19:04.300
She's right, Sheila. The least
we could do is see Arusu off.

00:19:04.579 --> 00:19:06.877
You'd better not go to
the Port of Departure.

00:19:06.948 --> 00:19:09.383
Huh? What's this?
What are you talking about?

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:11.578
You mean you didn't come here
to see me off...

00:19:11.686 --> 00:19:14.178
You just don't want me
to leave now, is that it?

00:19:14.689 --> 00:19:17.283
All I'm saying is that it would be
better not to go there.

00:19:17.391 --> 00:19:19.120
Well, I'm still going!

00:19:20.094 --> 00:19:22.859
Because a journey is something
you take in order to go home.

00:19:29.737 --> 00:19:32.263
This is the Port of Departure?

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:33.371
That's right.

00:19:33.674 --> 00:19:34.402
No way!

00:19:34.642 --> 00:19:35.700
No, this is for real.

00:19:35.943 --> 00:19:39.038
But I can't possibly get back
to the Human Realm this way!

00:19:39.513 --> 00:19:41.572
That's what I've been telling you.

00:19:42.049 --> 00:19:43.915
You shouldn't come here.

00:19:46.554 --> 00:19:49.546
| always thought this place was
called the Witches' Graveyard...

00:19:49.624 --> 00:19:52.616
...because it was where they
sent you to the Human Realm.

00:19:53.427 --> 00:19:56.260
But of all the people sent over
to the Human Realm...

00:19:56.364 --> 00:19:59.197
...almost nobody has ever made it
to the other side safely.

00:19:59.567 --> 00:20:03.026
This place really is a
witches' graveyard, you see!

00:20:06.307 --> 00:20:08.002
Yoko, I'm so sorry...

00:20:08.109 --> 00:20:10.635
It doesn't look like
I'll ever be getting home!

00:20:16.684 --> 00:20:24.648
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:24.892 --> 00:20:32.892
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:34.068 --> 00:20:42.068
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:43.311 --> 00:20:48.875
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:48.983 --> 00:20:53.216
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:53.988 --> 00:20:58.221
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:58.326 --> 00:21:02.888
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:03.097 --> 00:21:08.263
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:08.369 --> 00:21:11.430
Let's hope it does.

00:21:12.907 --> 00:21:17.538
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:17.645 --> 00:21:20.137
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:20.247 --> 00:21:28.247
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:29.423 --> 00:21:35.157
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:35.262 --> 00:21:39.426
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
